<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφεύγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flee from, escape</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμον περὶ τόνδε φυγόντε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.322
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάμμος ἀριθμὸν
			περιπέφευγεν</span> the sand <i>escapes</i> thy numbering,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.98
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν φθοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					677b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαθυμίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Mon.</u>
					467
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφοδον, πῦρ π</span>., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.171e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>escape from illness, come out of it alive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				54.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐκ [κυναγχέων]</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				604a10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>avoid especially</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως μὴ . . ἔσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					48
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
